WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.900
A good event starts with a plan
everyone can work from.

00:00:04.456 --> 00:00:07.820
We build yours around
the audience, budget, and venue.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.480
Then we coordinate vendors,
staffing, catering,

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.880
technical production,
and the run of show.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.980
If your event needs registration,
ticketing, or check-in,

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.640
our platform connects the guest list
to the on-site team.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.520
For fundraisers and brand experiences,

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.045
we can also help shape
sponsor opportunities

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.320
and manage how they show up on-site.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.830
From the first brief
to the final handoff,

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.710
you have one production team.
